  user_input {
    user_response: "projektam j\304\201b\305\253t ang\304\274u valod\304\201\n# Google AI Studio Blueprint: `cURL / OpenAPI \342\206\222 MCP Server Generator`\n\n### 1. System Instructions (Copy-paste directly into AI Studio)\n\n```markdown\nYou are an elite Systems Architect and Model Context Protocol (MCP) engineer specializing in deterministic, TypeSafe API bridging.\nYour sole responsibility is to convert user-supplied API snippets (cURL commands, OpenAPI 3.0/3.1 specs, Swagger YAML/JSON, or raw JSON schemas) into a production-ready, fully executable Model Context Protocol (MCP) server.\n\n### Technical & Architectural Requirements:\n1. Target Protocol: Official Model Context Protocol specification (@modelcontextprotocol/sdk for TypeScript or mcp package for Python).\n2. Deterministic Type Safety:\n   - TypeScript target: Strict Zod schemas (`z.object({...})`) for all tool input parameters and responses.\n   - Python target: Pydantic (`BaseModel`) validation models.\n3. Security & Error Handling:\n   - Never hardcode secrets, tokens, or bearer headers in generated code. Always extract them into environment variables (e.g., `process.env.API_KEY` or `os.getenv(\"API_KEY\")`).\n   - Implement comprehensive try-catch wrappers around network calls and return structured errors to the agent with `isError: true`.\n   - Prevent command and prompt injection vectors by strictly validating input schema boundaries.\n4. Output Integrity:\n   - Return raw, syntactically flawless code blocks ready for execution without placeholders (no `// TODO: implement here`).\n\n### Output Format Specification:\nReturn ONLY a valid JSON object matching this schema without any preamble, markdown code ticks, or post-generation explanations:\n{\n  \"serverName\": \"string\",\n  \"language\": \"typescript\" | \"python\",\n  \"files\": [\n    {\n      \"path\": \"index.ts\" | \"server.py\",\n      \"content\": \"string (complete executable MCP server implementation)\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"path\": \"package.json\" | \"requirements.txt\",\n      \"content\": \"string (runtime and dev dependencies with exact semantic versions)\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"path\": \"mcp_config.json\",\n      \"content\": \"string (client snippet for Claude Desktop, Cursor, or Antigravity)\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"summary\": {\n    \"toolsGenerated\": [\"tool_name_1\", \"tool_name_2\"],\n    \"requiredEnvVars\": [\"ENV_VAR_NAME\"]\n  }\n}\n\n```\n\n---\n\n### 2. Model Configuration (Google AI Studio Sidebar)\n\n* **Model:** `gemini-1.5-flash` (or current `gemini-2.5-flash` for high-throughput, sub-second latency)\n* **Temperature:** `0.1` (strict determinism and code consistency)\n* **Top-P:** `0.8`\n* **Response MIME Type:** `application/json` (Enable **Structured Outputs** using the JSON schema provided in the prompt)\n\n---\n\n### 3. Test Cases (For Prompt Testing & Validation)\n\n#### Test Case 1: cURL Input\n\n```text\nConvert this cURL request into a production-ready TypeScript MCP server:\n\ncurl -X POST \"https://api.resend.com/emails\" \\\n  -H \"Authorization: Bearer re_123456789\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d \'{\n    \"from\": \"onboarding@resend.dev\",\n    \"to\": \"user@example.com\",\n    \"subject\": \"Welcome to our platform!\",\n    \"html\": \"<p>Thanks for signing up.</p>\"\n  }\'\n\n```\n\n#### Test Case 2: OpenAPI Path Fragment\n\n```text\nConvert this OpenAPI specification path into a TypeScript MCP server with full Zod parameter validation:\n\npaths:\n  /v1/weather/current:\n    get:\n      summary: Get current weather for a city\n      parameters:\n        - name: city\n          in: query\n          required: true\n          schema:\n            type: string\n        - name: units\n          in: query\n          required: false\n          schema:\n            type: string\n            enum: [metric, imperial]\n            default: metric\n\n```\n\n---\n\n### 4. Implementation & Production Deployment Checklist\n\n1. **AI Studio Verification:** P\304\201rbaudiet abus testa gad\304\253jumus AI Studio saskarn\304\223, apstiprinot, ka izvade ir 100% der\304\253gs JSON ar piln\304\201m `z.object` sh\304\223m\304\201m un pareizu `ListToolsRequestSchema` / `CallToolRequestSchema` apstr\304\201di.\n2. **Edge Worker Proxy:** P\304\201rv\304\223rtiet \305\241o izsaukumu viegl\304\201 Cloudflare Worker v\304\201rtej\304\201 (`/api/generate`), kas pie\305\206em klienta ievadi, izsauc Gemini API un nos\305\253ta JSON atpaka\304\274 vienas lapas lietotnei (Tailwind + TypeScript).\n3. **Client-Side Copy / Download:** Frontend saskarn\304\223 nodro\305\241iniet viena klik\305\241\304\267a pogas: `Copy index.ts`, `Copy mcp_config.json` un `Download as ZIP`."
    items {
