    model_api_content_id: "tdjQavHNFbfmqtsP4ZuymA8"
  }
  planner_response {
    response: "The **cURL / OpenAPI \342\206\222 MCP Server Generator** has been built according to the blueprint specifications:\n\n### Core Capabilities\n* **Deterministic TypeSafe Code Generation:** Transforms raw cURL commands, OpenAPI 3.0/3.1 specs, Swagger YAML/JSON, or raw JSON schemas into production-ready Model Context Protocol (MCP) servers using strict Zod schemas (`z.object({...})`) for TypeScript (`@modelcontextprotocol/sdk`) or Pydantic models for Python (`FastMCP`).\n* **Security & Secret Extraction:** Automatically detects API keys, Bearer tokens, or credentials and isolates them into `.env.example` templates and environment variables (`process.env.API_KEY` / `os.getenv(\"API_KEY\")`) with no hardcoded secrets.\n* **Server-Side Gemini AI Engine:** Integrated with Google Gemini Flash via `/api/generate` with low temperature (`0.1`), top-p (`0.8`), and structured JSON outputs matching the blueprint schema, backed by a deterministic fallback generator.\n* **Multi-File Code Inspector:** Tabbed IDE interface for `index.ts` / `server.py`, `package.json` / `requirements.txt`, `mcp_config.json`, `README.md`, and `.env.example` with syntax line numbers and in-file search.\n* **One-Click Actions & Export:** Dedicated buttons to `Copy index.ts` (or `server.py`), `Copy mcp_config.json`, `Copy package.json`, and **Download as ZIP** (bundling complete runnable source files with `jszip`).\n* **Interactive Tool Simulator:** Built-in playground allowing users to test generated MCP tools, inspect simulated Claude Desktop JSON-RPC 2.0 payloads (`tools/call`), and view structured responses.\n* **Presets & Quick Setup:** Pre-loaded with **Test Case 1** (Resend Email API cURL) and **Test Case 2** (OpenAPI Weather fragment), alongside an interactive setup guide for Claude Desktop, Cursor, Antigravity, and `@modelcontextprotocol/inspector`."
    modified_response: "The **cURL / OpenAPI \342\206\222 MCP Server Generator** has been built according to the blueprint specifications:\n\n### Core Capabilities\n* **Deterministic TypeSafe Code Generation:** Transforms raw cURL commands, OpenAPI 3.0/3.1 specs, Swagger YAML/JSON, or raw JSON schemas into production-ready Model Context Protocol (MCP) servers using strict Zod schemas (`z.object({...})`) for TypeScript (`@modelcontextprotocol/sdk`) or Pydantic models for Python (`FastMCP`).\n* **Security & Secret Extraction:** Automatically detects API keys, Bearer tokens, or credentials and isolates them into `.env.example` templates and environment variables (`process.env.API_KEY` / `os.getenv(\"API_KEY\")`) with no hardcoded secrets.\n* **Server-Side Gemini AI Engine:** Integrated with Google Gemini Flash via `/api/generate` with low temperature (`0.1`), top-p (`0.8`), and structured JSON outputs matching the blueprint schema, backed by a deterministic fallback generator.\n* **Multi-File Code Inspector:** Tabbed IDE interface for `index.ts` / `server.py`, `package.json` / `requirements.txt`, `mcp_config.json`, `README.md`, and `.env.example` with syntax line numbers and in-file search.\n* **One-Click Actions & Export:** Dedicated buttons to `Copy index.ts` (or `server.py`), `Copy mcp_config.json`, `Copy package.json`, and **Download as ZIP** (bundling complete runnable source files with `jszip`).\n* **Interactive Tool Simulator:** Built-in playground allowing users to test generated MCP tools, inspect simulated Claude Desktop JSON-RPC 2.0 payloads (`tools/call`), and view structured responses.\n* **Presets & Quick Setup:** Pre-loaded with **Test Case 1** (Resend Email API cURL) and **Test Case 2** (OpenAPI Weather fragment), alongside an interactive setup guide for Claude Desktop, Cursor, Antigravity, and `@modelcontextprotocol/inspector`."
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
    thinking_signature: "\022\347\002\n\344\002\001i\024}\023a\221_\263\343\034\255\215Og\353\036\255\334\001\235\241P\211\325\216\275\3102Z\273I\231\304\021\255\242\215\271og(\254\030\277\"\005TlU\b\201j\346\215o\262\304(U\005(e\356q\326\343J\265\204^\272\242\235\226\001\362\261\n\376\201`\200\263\363/\213\370u\366\355\236\243\336k\333\367#\207\244(\332\037><\342\363\340\215\375(\354)\314\225l\226`\241d]1L_.\345d\307\353\021\330z\"\312X\245\203\241\355?\000\371-\022\356\027!\253\022\242\247a\210Kt\325p6\351\b\t\233\227Lqt\0234\001\316\217\241)z>,Epk\200 y\200\334\343t\355K\024\367u&\251\275\272\242L \225\rX\213\337\253^\024O\276M\237*K\352h&\325\2716\223~\327\t\300\026\020\322@\025Hy\326v\030\232:\002\200\314z\002\251\277NO8\360.\3565`2\243o\035\373\233\266\313Q\005\233\230\330\345\220\034D\257\b\f\237\336\306\214@o\225\376\330>\324\027\356\314\2107\260M\005ou\334W<\204\215\325\372\333\226\330\005\377\254\321\342\262J\017\0221\305\030\016\320\333\177\252\263Vd\3614\363\a\346\t-\2635q\216\033\237\256T\3135\371\b\f\342D\357\266\033\372k\317\3225\246J\212f}"
